/Title (A virtual cinema space accessible via web-browser where live audiences watch films together as avatars in a social videogame. The cinema specialises in Pan-African and experimental films made in collaboration with Johannesburg-based Immersive Studio SodaWorld. I was the director and designer of the virtual world, managing a world builder who created the space between February and April 2025. Images show examples of my copy written to appear in the video game environement.)
